# ============================================================
# Code Owners for agcli-registry
# ============================================================
# Rules follow "last match wins". Specific rules override the
# default when written after it. When adding a new group, add
# a corresponding line at the end of this file.
# ============================================================

# Default: all changes require maintainer approval
*  @agcli-dev/maintainers

# ----------------------------------------------------------
# Capsule declarations — grouped by directory
# Format: capsules/<group>/  @user1 @user2 ...
# PR CI requires an explicit line per changed group (see check-capsule-ownership.yml).
#
# Note: CODEOWNERS can only reference teams within the same
# org. To authorize contributors outside the org, list their
# individual GitHub usernames directly.
# For example: capsules/acme-corp/  @jsmith @mchen
# ----------------------------------------------------------

# Official capsules (maintained by agcli team)
#capsules/official/  @agcli-dev/maintainers
#capsules/dev.agcli/  @agcli-dev/maintainers
capsules/dev.agcli.showcase/  @agcli-dev/maintainers

# ---------- Third-party groups (uncomment and replace with actual usernames) ----------

# Examples:
# capsules/globaltech/     @mwatanabe








